                "description": "Fusion 16-S9, Clear Glass Knob With Venice Rose - The ornate Victorian Clear Knob with the Venice Rose is a sparkling reminder of the old world. Available in 5 finishes, all of which enhance the elegant allure of this knob set. It is available in either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset; and will adjust to door thicknesses from 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches.",
